# Secrets never live here, but belt and braces. Every pattern is listed in
# both cases because .gitignore, rsync and zip matching are all case sensitive.
.env*
.ENV*
*credential*
*CREDENTIAL*
*cred*
*CRED*
*password*
*PASSWORD*
*secret*
*SECRET*
*token*
*TOKEN*
*sftp*
*SFTP*
*ftp*
*FTP*
*.pem
*.PEM
*.key
*.KEY
*.pfx
*.PFX
id_rsa*
ID_RSA*
connection.txt
CONNECTION.TXT
*config.local*
*CONFIG.LOCAL*
